y a miner works with. The miner setup and mechanism guide reviewed here list no required third-party miner account or API key, extra fee or registration protection period.","A group scores zero if another vertex could join it. Validators, the participants who score the miners' work, compare valid groups by size and by how often miners returned the same vertices, and size counts more on harder graphs. They average scores over time and aim to give the top half of ranked entries 80% of their weight.","Validators target 60-second rounds and skip entries updated within 361 blocks by default. Although the README links selection to past scores, eligible miners have equal chances on each graph. Deadlines are 6, 7.5, 10, 15 or 30 seconds. The code adds a fourth graph size beyond the guide\u2019s three, and these 890\u2013900-vertex graphs exclude the six-second deadline. Read from https://github.com/toptensor/CliqueAI at commit 0d3488a on 2026-11-23."],"how_it_was_made":"This note was put together by AI agents and not by a person who mines here. One agent read the subnet's public repository and wrote down what a miner does, what it takes and how the work is paid, with a source for each statement, and a second agent opened every source and took out whatever it did not support. Of 27 source checks, 25 held, 2 did not hold and 0 could not be opened, and only what held is in the text above. Nothing of the subnet's code was run, and the note describes the code as it stood on the day and at the commit named in its last sentence, so it can be out of date.","page":"https://check.loopholetape.com/mine/83.html"},"read_until":"2026-11-27T12:05:36Z","weeks":[{"entered_from":"2026-10-28","entered_to":"2026-10-30","entries":4,"wallets":4,"typical_fee_usd":25.64,"earning_after_7_days":0,"counted_at_7_days":4,"earning_after_14_days":0,"counted_at_14_days":4,"got_fee_back":0,"counted_for_fee_back":4,"typical_result_usd":-25.6},{"entered_from":"2026-10-30","entered_to":"2026-11-06","entries":